# L3/I5 — gli strumenti del contatto si imparano per contatto (§1-bis n. 4, §16.1).
# KB agi completa, nessun ponte seminato, nessuno strumento scritto in KB: il
# maestro parla in lingua naturale con fatti veri. Le query diagnosticano.
# Fissato il 25 settembre 2026, scritto insieme alla cura (dichiarato).
[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test prima: lo strumento nuovo blocca il contatto, e non e scritto da nessuna parte]
!timeout 0
!query! contact_instrument($C, $F)
> Einstein was born in Ulm; in other words, his Geburtsort is Ulm.
!query! contact_episode(geburtsort, born_in, $E)
!query contact_near(born_in, ep(einstein, ulm, s), $Ws)
> What is the Geburtsort of Napoleon?
<~ I don't know about geburtsort
<! ajaccio

[test una relazione sola non basta a indurre lo strumento]
!timeout 0
> Galileo Galilei was born in Pisa; in other words, his Heimatstadt is Pisa.
!query! contact_instrument($C, $F)
!query! contact_episode(heimatstadt, born_in, $E)

[test una seconda relazione con le stesse parole in piu: lo strumento nasce, i contatti in sospeso si rileggono]
!timeout 0
> Steel is made of iron; in other words, its Werkstoff is iron.
!query contact_instrument(cons(words, nil), $F)
!query contact_instrument_in_force(cons(words, nil))
!query contact_episode(geburtsort, born_in, ep(einstein, ulm, s))
!query contact_episode(werkstoff, made_of, ep(steel, iron, s))
> What is the Geburtsort of Napoleon?
<~ ajaccio
> What is the Werkstoff of glass?
<~ sand

[test caso tenuto fuori: relazione nuova, lo strumento appreso basta]
!timeout 0
> France borders Spain; in other words, its Nachbar is Spain.
!query contact_episode(nachbar, borders, $E)
!query! contact_near(borders, $E, $Ws)
> What is the Nachbar of Italy?
<~ austria

[mock live]
!set PARROT0_SESSION=
!set PARROT0_PROFILE=kb/profiles/agi.p0
!set PARROT0_LANG=en
!reset

[test uno strumento sbagliato si induce da due coincidenze vere]
!timeout 0
> Rome is in Italy; moreover, Rome is its capital.
> Galileo Galilei was born in Pisa; moreover, Pisa is his university.
!query contact_instrument_in_force(cons(moreover, nil))
!query contact_episode(capital, located_in, $E)
!query contact_episode(university, born_in, $E)

[test la condizione appresa si corregge con lo stesso circuito: controesempi ordinari]
!timeout 0
> Milan is in Italy, but Milan is not its capital.
!query contact_instrument_in_force(cons(moreover, nil))
> Einstein was born in Ulm, but Ulm is not his university.
!query! contact_instrument_in_force(cons(moreover, nil))
!query contact_instrument(cons(moreover, nil), $F)
!query born_in(einstein, ulm)
> Where was Einstein born?
<~ ulm

[test caso tenuto fuori dopo la correzione: lo strumento screditato non insegna, uno buono si]
!timeout 0
> Napoleon was born in Ajaccio; moreover, his Geburtsort is Ajaccio.
!query! contact_episode(geburtsort, born_in, $E)
> What is the Geburtsort of Galileo Galilei?
<! pisa
> Einstein was born in Ulm; in other words, his Geburtsort is Ulm.
> Steel is made of iron; in other words, its Werkstoff is iron.
!query contact_instrument_in_force(cons(words, nil))
!query! contact_instrument_in_force(cons(moreover, nil))
> What is the Geburtsort of Galileo Galilei?
<~ pisa
> What is the capital of Germany?
<~ Berlin
